# Ceylon: Ceylon language specification 1.3, lexical structure; requirements/languages/ceylon.md
name     ceylon
keyword  assembly module package import alias class interface object given value assign void function
keyword  new of extends satisfies abstracts in out return break continue throw assert dynamic if else
keyword  switch case for while try catch finally then let this outer super is exists nonempty
keyword  shared formal default actual variable late native
type     String Integer Float Boolean Character Anything Object Null Nothing
builtin  true false null print
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   """ """  : multiline
string   " "      : escapes
string   ' '      : escapes
escape        : u-braces
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
upper-type
calls
